// MPEG-1 and MPEG-2 video: the code tables of ISO/IEC 13818-2 Annex B
// (the same as ISO/IEC 11172-2 Annex B for MPEG-1), scan orders, default
// quantiser matrices, and the lookup tables built from them.
//
// Variable-length codes are listed as (code, length, value) triples, the
// code without its sign bit. `m12Build` turns a list into a two-level
// lookup table that `m12Vlc` style decoders read with one peek of the
// longest code's length.
//
// Author: Alexius Academia
// Date: 2026-10-25

import "../core"

